{
  "slug": "kth-missing-positive-number",
  "hints": [
    "For an element at index i, compare arr[i] with i+1 to see how many positive integers are missing before or at that element.",
    "Define missing(i) = arr[i] - (i + 1). This value is nondecreasing because arr is strictly increasing.",
    "Binary-search for the first index whose missing count is at least k.",
    "If that index does not exist, all remaining missing values are after the array; the same formula k + right + 1 handles both cases."
  ],
  "title": "K-th Missing Positive Number",
  "content": {
